      <eaover>Values are CODES FOR LANDSCAPE ELEMENTS described in the MSPA Guide included with the GUIDOS package. GUIDOS is available at forest.jrc.ec.europa.eu/download/software/guidos. The codes are: 0 Background, 1 Branch, 3 Edge, 5 Perforation, 9 Islet, 17 Core, 100 Interior Background, and 129 (No Data).
			
The landscape elements are based on the National Land Cover Database (NLCD). NLCD classes were reclassified to either foreground or background depending on the type of connectivity measured (See processing steps for specific classes).</eaover>
      		
