        <stepDesc>Connectivity data were derived using the GUIDOS (Graphical User Interface for the Description of image Objects and their Shapes) Workbench 1.9.8 (GWB1.9.8) raster image processing toolbox, which includes the Simplified Pattern Analysis (SPA) module, a downscaled version of Morphological Spatial Pattern Analysis tool (MSPA). Run GWB1.9.8 (https://forest.jrc.ec.europa.eu/en/activities/lpa/gtb/#Download) using, using 8 neighbor connectivity, 1 pixel edge width, transition and intext on.</stepDesc>
        				
